    "cover": {
      "eyebrow": "网球有故事",
      "layout": "solo",
      "story_kind": "person",
      "subject": "科博利",
      "hook": "从四连败出发\n他拿到了都灵门票",
      "topic": "科博利：从四连败到年终门票",
      "portrait": {
        "image": "assets/reel/cobolli-finals-2026/cover-rg-fist-2026.jpg",
        "fit": "cover",
        "focus": 0.2,
        "focus_y": 0.45,
        "zoom": 1.0,
        "source_url": "https://www.rolandgarros.com/en-us/photo-gallery/gallery-photos-final-men-singles-zverev-cobolli"
      },
      "scrim": "clear"
    },
    "segments": [
      {
        "narration": "年初四连败，年末第一次入围总决赛。科博利的这一年，中间隔着多少次重新出发？",
        "seconds": 8.104,
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+0Hz"
        },
        "image": "assets/reel/cobolli-finals-2026/cover-rg-fist-2026-3x4.jpg",
        "image_kind": "photo"
      },
      {
        "narration": "从联合杯到澳网，再到蒙彼利埃和达拉斯，四场单打连败。这个赛季，他的开局很难。",
        "seconds": 8.728,
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+0Hz"
        },
        "title_card": "四场连败\n澳网止步首轮",
        "kicker": "一月 · 低谷"
      },
      {
        "source": "ao_r1",
        "start": 436.1,
        "end": 471.8,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "fit": "crop",
        "track": false,
        "narration": "",
        "audio_tail": "silence",
        "quote": [
          {
            "at": 0.98,
            "end": 4.8,
            "text": "Fery's second break in the third set.\n费里在第三盘第二次破发。"
          },
          {
            "at": 4.8,
            "end": 10.22,
            "text": "Scoreline looking very, very positive for the Brit.\n比分对这位英国选手非常有利。"
          },
          {
            "at": 26.58,
            "end": 31.8,
            "text": "And on debut, Arthur Fery is through to the second round.\n澳网首秀，费里闯进第二轮。"
          },
          {
            "at": 31.8,
            "end": 35.5,
            "text": "It's a huge win. Straight sets.\n一场大胜，直落三盘。"
          }
        ],
        "inset": {
          "image": "assets/reel/cobolli-finals-2026/context-ao_terminal.png",
          "kind": "story_text",
          "corner": "tr",
          "width": 0.6,
          "pad": 0.043,
          "show_for": 8,
          "motion": "editorial",
          "label": {
            "topic": "澳网首轮止步",
            "date": "2026.01.18",
            "place": "澳网首轮",
            "people": "科博利 vs 费里",
            "score": "6-7(1) 4-6 1-6",
            "result": {
              "winner": "费里",
              "score": "7-6(1) 6-4 6-1",
              "source": "https://www.lta.org.uk/fan-zone/wimbledon-championships/news/who-is-british-wild-card-arthur-fery"
            }
          },
          "show_after": 0,
          "animate": false
        }
      },
      {
        "narration": "直到德尔雷海滩，他才又连续赢球，打进四强。接下来的阿卡普尔科，这一次，他把奖杯带走了。",
        "seconds": 9.28,
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+0Hz"
        },
        "title_card": "重新赢球\n第一座硬地冠军",
        "kicker": "二月 · 转机"
      },
      {
        "narration": "决赛七比六、六比四击败蒂亚福，拿下生涯首座硬地巡回赛冠军。五百分到手，赛季终于有了亮色。",
        "seconds": 9.64,
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+0Hz"
        },
        "image": "assets/reel/cobolli-finals-2026/acapulco-trophy-2026-3x4.jpg",
        "image_kind": "photo"
      },
      {
        "source": "acapulco_final",
        "start": 129.3,
        "end": 143.4,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "fit": "crop",
        "track": false,
        "narration": "",
        "audio_tail": "silence",
        "quote": [
          {
            "at": 2.44,
            "end": 6.32,
            "text": "Acapulco belongs to Flavio.\n阿卡普尔科，属于弗拉维奥。"
          },
          {
            "at": 6.32,
            "end": 8.84,
            "text": "Cobolli the champion.\n科博利，冠军！"
          },
          {
            "at": 10.6,
            "end": 13.26,
            "text": "A second ATP 500 title.\n第二座五百分赛冠军。"
          }
        ],
        "inset": {
          "image": "assets/reel/cobolli-finals-2026/context-acapulco_terminal.png",
          "kind": "story_text",
          "corner": "tr",
          "width": 0.6,
          "pad": 0.043,
          "show_for": 8,
          "motion": "editorial",
          "label": {
            "topic": "首座硬地冠军",
            "date": "2026.02.28",
            "place": "阿卡普尔科决赛",
            "people": "科博利 vs 蒂亚福",
            "score": "7-6(4) 6-4",
            "result": {
              "winner": "科博利",
              "score": "7-6(4) 6-4",
              "source": "https://www.atptour.com/en/news/cobolli-tiafoe-acapulco-2026-final"
            }
          },
          "show_after": 0,
          "animate": false
        }
      },
      {
        "narration": "印第安维尔斯第三轮，迈阿密首战失利，蒙特卡洛第二轮。三月到四月，成绩仍有起伏。",
        "seconds": 8.824,
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+0Hz"
        },
        "title_card": "冠军之后\n仍有起伏",
        "kicker": "三月至四月"
      },
      {
        "narration": "四月的慕尼黑，他在半决赛六比三、六比三击败兹维列夫。决赛输给谢尔顿，也拿到了三百三十分。",
        "seconds": 9.544,
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+0Hz"
        },
        "image": "assets/reel/cobolli-finals-2026/munich-final-action-2026-3x4.jpg",
        "image_kind": "photo"
      },
      {
        "source": "munich_final",
        "start": 430.3,
        "end": 445.9,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "fit": "crop",
        "track": false,
        "narration": "",
        "audio_tail": "silence",
        "quote": [
          {
            "at": 3.28,
            "end": 12.48,
            "text": "Ben Shelton is the 2026 BMW Open by Bitpanda champion here in Munich.\n谢尔顿是二〇二六年慕尼黑冠军！"
          },
          {
            "at": 12.48,
            "end": 15.42,
            "text": "Runner-up 12 months ago.\n十二个月前，他是亚军。"
          }
        ],
        "inset": {
          "image": "assets/reel/cobolli-finals-2026/context-munich_terminal.png",
          "kind": "story_text",
          "corner": "tr",
          "width": 0.6,
          "pad": 0.043,
          "show_for": 8,
          "motion": "editorial",
          "label": {
